                                "sense_id": "bd8adf6d-eff0-3162-bca6-eb569e502080",
                                "text": "Plain and unexciting, perhaps, but they are solid, well cooked, appetising and filling, and moreover cheap."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5aec7ff-488b-42af-a98e-753310993bdc",
                                "sense_id": "bd8adf6d-eff0-3162-bca6-eb569e502080",
                                "text": "B. Wooster: Of all the places on this great planet of ours, West Neck, Long Island, has chosen to be the most unexciting. The last time anything remotely interesting happened here was in 1842, when a tree fell over. They still talk about it in the village."
                            }
